      <title>特斯拉拉美版图再扩张：哥伦比亚，下一个增长极？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251112-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89%E7%BE%8E%E7%89%88%E5%9B%BE%E5%86%8D%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%E5%93%A5%E4%BC%A6%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9A%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF%E6%9E%81/</link>
